    "long_instructions": "## Investigate\r\n\r\nRun the code again and look at the output.\r\n\r\n**Trace it:** Before line 2 runs, `age` doesn't exist yet. After line 2\r\nruns, what value does `age` store? Finish the comment on line 2 with\r\nyour answer.\r\n\r\n**Tinker:** Add a new line after line 3: `is_a_student = False`. Run\r\nthe code again. What changed in the output? Why did it change?\r\n\r\n**Comment it:** Finish the comment on line 4, explaining what `input()`\r\ndoes in this line.",
